        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description and gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Real Puzzles - Kittens&quot; is a logical puzzle game in the form of puzzles. It is necessary to assemble a whole picture from its individual pieces. The game is suitable for those who are looking for a calm and relaxing pastime with family or alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics and sound</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graphics in the game are detailed, bright and colorful. The overall visual design creates a pleasant and cozy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack includes the sound effect of installing the desired puzzle in its place and background music, which together help and enhance the feeling of relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle begins with its own background melody.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a volume control (mute) of the music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.poster.avif?t=1787732230\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.webm?t=1787732230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.mp4?t=1787732230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advantages:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attractive visual style - assemble a picture from pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element is made like a real puzzle - with protrusions and cutouts, into which you need to substitute the corresponding other puzzle piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 languages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 levels with wonderful cute fluffy kittens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each image is divided into 36 elements (6х6).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles can be selected and assembled in any order at your discretion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can exit the current one at any time and select another puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updating/resetting/shuffling puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusting screen brightness for each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewing the image being assembled (hint).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To facilitate assembly, the original picture that needs to be assembled is slightly visible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To change the difficulty level, you can change the visibility of the original image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzle elements fit into their place with a margin (stick with a magnet effect) with a simultaneous announcement that the puzzle is in the right place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A correctly installed puzzle can no longer be moved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To facilitate assembly, there is no need to rotate the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implemented protection against moving the puzzle beyond the edge of the screen or disappearing under the puzzles already installed in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the puzzle assembly, the time spent on assembling the current image is displayed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After assembling any puzzle, the picture &quot;comes to life&quot; - our Know-How!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The presence of 19 achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World ranking of amateur puzzle solvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for new levels and puzzles via DLC.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disadvantages:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps some shortcomings will be noticed, which, of course, will have to be corrected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the nearest plans:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>collectible cards</strong>. But it depends on your activity and positive reviews. I do not insist, but I hope that you will like my game and you will tell about it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enough reading - time to play!</strong></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description and gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Real Puzzles - Kittens&quot; is a logical puzzle game in the form of puzzles. It is necessary to assemble a whole picture from its individual pieces. The game is suitable for those who are looking for a calm and relaxing pastime with family or alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics and sound</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graphics in the game are detailed, bright and colorful. The overall visual design creates a pleasant and cozy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack includes the sound effect of installing the desired puzzle in its place and background music, which together help and enhance the feeling of relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle begins with its own background melody.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a volume control (mute) of the music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.poster.avif?t=1787732230\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.webm?t=1787732230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914300/extras/d5cdb17d907b2561acc950b08320d2df.mp4?t=1787732230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advantages:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attractive visual style - assemble a picture from pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element is made like a real puzzle - with protrusions and cutouts, into which you need to substitute the corresponding other puzzle piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 languages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 levels with wonderful cute fluffy kittens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each image is divided into 36 elements (6х6).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles can be selected and assembled in any order at your discretion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can exit the current one at any time and select another puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updating/resetting/shuffling puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusting screen brightness for each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewing the image being assembled (hint).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To facilitate assembly, the original picture that needs to be assembled is slightly visible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To change the difficulty level, you can change the visibility of the original image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzle elements fit into their place with a margin (stick with a magnet effect) with a simultaneous announcement that the puzzle is in the right place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A correctly installed puzzle can no longer be moved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To facilitate assembly, there is no need to rotate the puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implemented protection against moving the puzzle beyond the edge of the screen or disappearing under the puzzles already installed in place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the puzzle assembly, the time spent on assembling the current image is displayed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After assembling any puzzle, the picture &quot;comes to life&quot; - our Know-How!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The presence of 19 achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World ranking of amateur puzzle solvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for new levels and puzzles via DLC.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disadvantages:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps some shortcomings will be noticed, which, of course, will have to be corrected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the nearest plans:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>collectible cards</strong>. But it depends on your activity and positive reviews. I do not insist, but I hope that you will like my game and you will tell about it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Enough reading - time to play!</strong></h2>",
